<element><id>UMLSequenceAllInOne</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>20</y><w>1710</w><h>825</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>title:SD3 Savings Goal and Savings Recommendation (F05, F08)
obj=User~u
obj=SavingsGoalGUI~g
obj=SavingsController~c
obj=SavingsGoalBuilder~b
obj=SavingsGoal~sg
obj=Account~ac
obj=DatabaseService~db
obj=FinancialDataFacade~f
obj=SavingsAI~ai
obj=AIServiceProxy~px
u-&gt;g: submitGoal(name, target, timeframe, account)
g-&gt;c: createGoal(details)
c-&gt;b: setGoalDetails(name, target, timeframe)
c-&gt;b: setLinkedAccount(account)
c-&gt;b: build()
b--&gt;c: SavingsGoal
c-&gt;db: saveGoal(goal)
db--&gt;c: confirmation
c-&gt;sg: calculateProgress()
sg-&gt;ac: getBalance()
ac--&gt;sg: balance
sg--&gt;c: percentage
c--&gt;g: display progress bar
u-&gt;g: requestRecommendation()
g-&gt;c: generateSavingsRecommendation(goalId)
c-&gt;f: getFinancialData(userId)
f-&gt;db: load accounts, expenses, goals
db--&gt;f: records
f--&gt;c: FinancialData
c-&gt;ai: analyzeSavingsGoal(goal, data)
ai-&gt;ai: calculateMonthlyTarget(goal, data)
ai-&gt;px: generateResponse(request)
px--&gt;ai: AIResponse
ai--&gt;c: Recommendation
c--&gt;g: display amount and advice
</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
<element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>875</y><w>1710</w><h>142</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Alternative flows
- Invalid goal fields: user is asked to correct them.
- No savings goal: user is asked to create one.
- Missing income/expense data: user is asked to provide it, then retries.
- Linked balance falls or is negative: calculateProgress() lowers the percentage or shows 'no money saved yet' (it re-reads the balance each time it is displayed).
- AI unavailable: user is told to try again later.
- Database retrieval fails: user is told the data could not be retrieved.</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
</diagram>
